OL,3,GNEWSASchool raffles Amazon vouchers to
OL,4,Astop GTA 6 skiving
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn Essex secondary school is entering
OL,7,Fstudents into a raffle for #10 Amazon
OL,8,Fvouchers and free Christmas dinners, as
OL,9,Fincentives to stop pupils bunking off
OL,10,Fto play Grand Theft Auto (GTA) 6.
OL,12,FOne of the most anticipated video games
OL,13,Fof all time dropped in the UK at
OL,14,Fmidnight, after being released in other
OL,15,Fparts of the world on Wednesday.
OL,17,FTo avoid empty classrooms for the rest
OL,18,Fof the week, Sandon School in
OL,19,FChelmsford said a lunchtime queue jump
OL,20,Fpass for the rest of the academic year
OL,21,Fwas also among the raffle prizes on
OL,22,Foffer.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
